<title>DENMARK: Hypotekbanken ups 4 pct 2005 bond by 250 mln DKK.</title>
<headline>Hypotekbanken ups 4 pct 2005 bond by 250 mln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Hypotekbanken has raised the amount of an existing four percent bond, due 2005, by 250 million crowns to 1.175 billion, arranger Gudme Raschou said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>All bonds had been sold, it added. --Joern Nurkka, Copenhagen newsroom + (45) 33969655</p>
</text>
